---
layout: base.njk
title: Research Notes
description: Short research notes, conference reflections and accessible food-science explainers.
permalink: /blog/index.html
---
<section class="page-hero container narrow">
<p class="eyebrow">Blog</p>
<h1>Research notes.</h1>
<p class="lede">Short posts on food science, research methods, conference ideas and useful questions that sit around the formal publication record.</p>
</section>

<section class="section">
<div class="container narrow post-list">
{% for post in collections.posts %}
<article>
  <time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
  <h2><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
  <p>{{ post.data.summary }}</p>
  <a class="text-link" href="{{ post.url }}">Read post →</a>
</article>
{% endfor %}
</div>
</section>
